cmd.play.long:
Searches tracks, artists and the playlists in the local cache in one go (playlists show up after you run capy pl list).
In a terminal, a single clear match plays right away; otherwise a picker opens. Without a TTY it's always deterministic: an ambiguous query exits 2 and prints the candidates as TSV (type, id, label, detail);
set the type with --type or a prefix (artist: / pl: / track:) and scripts get the same result every time.
